<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Ac8265 on 我的博客</title><link>https://wangqian306.github.io/tags/ac8265/</link><description>Recent content in Ac8265 on 我的博客</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 23 Aug 2019 18:36:55 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://wangqian306.github.io/tags/ac8265/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>deepin编译安装intel ac8265 wifi 驱动</title><link>https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/</link><pubDate>Fri, 23 Aug 2019 18:36:55 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823140001.png" alt="Featured image of post deepin编译安装intel ac8265 wifi 驱动" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;本人笔记本装的是intel ac8265 wifi芯片，deepin默认的驱动可以用，但是wifi上网很慢&#10;看到deepin论坛里有人自己编译重装了wifi驱动，我也试着编译安装了一下&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="1先安装iwlwifi固件"&gt;1.先安装iwlwifi固件&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;iwlwifi是类似于一个驱动管理器的一个东西（我是这么理解的）&#10;&lt;a class="link" href="https://wireless.wiki.kernel.org/en/users/drivers/iwlwifi" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;https://wireless.wiki.kernel.org/en/users/drivers/iwlwifi&lt;/a&gt;&#10;在这个页面下载8265对应的iwlwifi固件包&#10;&lt;a class="link" href="https://wireless.wiki.kernel.org/_media/en/users/drivers/iwlwifi-8265-ucode-22.361476.0.tgz" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;Intel® Wireless-AC 8265&#9;4.6+&#9;iwlmvm&#9;iwlwifi-8265-ucode-22.361476.0.tgz&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="深度截图_选择区域_20190823140001.png" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="2786px" data-flex-grow="1160" height="82" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823140001.png" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823140001_hu_39836b9f460bd9ef.png 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823140001.png 952w" width="952"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;下载完毕以后解压安装&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;tar -xvf iwlwifi-8265-ucode-22.361476.0.tgz&#10;cd iwlwifi-8265-ucode-22.361476.0/&#10;ls&#10;sudo cp iwlwifi-*.ucode /lib/firmware&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="深度截图_选择区域_20190823140204.png" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="1214px" data-flex-grow="506" height="193" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823140204.png" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823140204_hu_7ef5771e80c07cbd.png 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823140204.png 977w" width="977"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="2下载8265的驱动源码包"&gt;2.下载8265的驱动源码包&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="link" href="https://wireless.wiki.kernel.org/en/users/drivers/iwlwifi/core_release?s[]=8265" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;https://wireless.wiki.kernel.org/en/users/drivers/iwlwifi/core_release?s[]=8265&lt;/a&gt;&#10;这个网页有详细的教程说明&#10;首先git clone&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;git clone https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/iwlwifi/backport-iwlwifi.git&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="深度截图_选择区域_20190823140541.png" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="2376px" data-flex-grow="990" height="150" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823140541.png" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823140541_hu_b291e978154e5568.png 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823140541.png 1485w" width="1485"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;然后make一下配置&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;sudo make defconfig-iwlwifi-public&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="深度截图_选择区域_20190823141407.png" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="2428px" data-flex-grow="1012" height="108" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823141407.png" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823141407_hu_4657464aad22b39a.png 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823141407.png 1093w" width="1093"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;然后关闭vendor commands功能（官网上讲这个功能有兼容性bug）&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;sed -i 's/CPTCFG_IWLMVM_VENDOR_CMDS=y/# CPTCFG_IWLMVM_VENDOR_CMDS is not set/' .config&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="深度截图_选择区域_20190823141710.png" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="7570px" data-flex-grow="3154" height="33" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823141710.png" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823141710_hu_1a6a730195701871.png 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823141710.png 1041w" width="1041"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="3编译编译错误及修复"&gt;3.编译，编译错误及修复&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;经常玩Linux的都知道，下载源码编译经常会碰到错误，这个时候只能自己一个一个百度谷歌修复&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;make&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="深度截图_选择区域_20190823141919.png" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="572px" data-flex-grow="238" height="718" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823141919.png" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823141919_hu_e97187ed65c75ea4.png 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823141919_hu_4d9f41537934b27.png 1600w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823141919.png 1712w" width="1712"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;这里提示整型常量上有一个无效的后缀&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="深度截图_选择区域_20190823142114.png" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="4670px" data-flex-grow="1946" height="52" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823142114.png" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823142114_hu_bc846cfffd61f156.png 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823142114.png 1012w" width="1012"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;百度搜索了一下这个宏UTS_UBUNTU_RELEASE_ABI，应该是&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;blockquote&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;Ubuntu发行版应用程序接口&#10;是一个整型，数字越大说明版本越高，所以deepin这里改成30deepin确实是一种不兼容的写法&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;那我就把它改回去，改成30应该就可以了&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;不过按照错误提示中给出的路径，找不到这个头文件utsrelease.h&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;find . -name utsrelease.h 2&amp;gt;/dev/null&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="深度截图_选择区域_20190823142730.png" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="5295px" data-flex-grow="2206" height="46" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823142730.png" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823142730_hu_31332e6b2b5c033a.png 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823142730.png 1015w" width="1015"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;经我打开鉴定，不是搜索的到的这个文件&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;可能是deepin的系统文件吧，那就全盘搜索&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;find / -name utsrelease.h 2&amp;gt;/dev/null&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="深度截图_选择区域_20190823142925.png" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="4181px" data-flex-grow="1742" height="66" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823142925.png" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823142925_hu_b71662fd8dc9f58e.png 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823142925.png 1150w" width="1150"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;果然找到了,打开看一下&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;sudo vi /usr/src/linux-headers-4.15.0-30deepin-generic/include/generated/utsrelease.h &#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="深度截图_选择区域_20190823143128.png" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="725px" data-flex-grow="302" height="281" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823143128.png" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823143128_hu_ad28a9b8f5d9236b.png 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/deepin%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85intel-ac8265-wifi-%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F_20190823143128.png 850w" width="850"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;就是这个没错了，把deepin删掉就行了&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;再次编译,安装，成功&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;sudo make&#10;sudo make install&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="深度截图_20190823132757.png" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="1080" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 